OL,3,GNEWSAMum turned bodybuilder at 40 and
OL,4,Ais now winning big
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother of two who took up
OL,7,Fbodybuilding when she turned 40 has won
OL,8,Fmultiple competitions and two British
OL,9,Ftitles.
OL,11,FDanielle Cooper, 44, first started
OL,12,Fcompeting in 2024, and has juggled the
OL,13,Fsport with family life and running her
OL,14,Fown online coaching business.
OL,16,FShe told BBC Radio Lancashire: "It all
OL,17,Fstarted when I turned 40. My focus was
OL,18,Fmy kids, my family, the family
OL,19,Fbusiness, and I just wanted something
OL,20,Ffor me that I could pour my energy
OL,21,Finto."
